Provenance note
---------------
This package is a ROS 2 Humble adaptation of the ROS 1 `joy` package. The
original ROS 1 `src/joy_node.cpp` (BSD, Willow Garage) is not copied into this
package because the generic driver is replaced by upstream
`joy_linux/joy_linux_node`. The original `scripts/joy_remap.py` author notice is
retained in adapted form in `joy/restricted_evaluator.py`, `joy/remap_core.py`
and `joy/joy_remap.py`, and its YAML expressions are retained verbatim in
`config/ps4joy.yaml`.
